xt":"Deliver 4 Iron to a planet with a station you’d like to upgrade","done":true},{"id":"upgrade_to_large_station","text":"Upgrade a Station to a Large Station","done":true}],"details":"Stations only allow one train (in low orbit) to load or unload at a time, while a Large Station can accommodate trains in two orbits.","reward":50000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.5787127174004,"completedSd":830.0020479803273,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"visitedSnapshot":[1017,1016,1018,1019]},{"id":"galactic_distance","name":"Galactic Distance Record","imageType":"car","imageKey":"car_passenger","objectives":[{"id":"deliver_15k_au","text":"Deliver any cargo or passengers on a single trip of more than 15,000 SU","done":true}],"details":"Can your trains go the distance? Complete a single cargo delivery trip of more than 15,000 SU — note that this exceeds the maximum range of the Constellation class engine, so a more powerful engine will be required.","reward":30000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.6319382822822,"completedSd":831.0172126473498,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"_longHaulDone":true,"visitedSnapshot":[1017,1016,1018,1019]},{"id":"dispose_hazmat","name":"Dispose of Hazmat","imageType":"car","imageKey":"car_hazmat","objectives":[{"id":"incinerate_hazmat","text":"Incinerate 2.0 units of Hazmat","done":true}],"details":"Industrial activity produces Hazmat as a by-product. As Hazmat accumulates on a planet, it drags down the planet's productivity & its people's happiness. Pick up Hazmat from a planet with Hazmat cars & transport it to the nearest star for incineration.","reward":8000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.8134660966942,"completedSd":829.9923611177012,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPla