 mineral deposits and may attract significant freight interest soon.","pageNum":12}},{"sd":831,"layout":1,"issueNum":2,"paperName":"The Stellar Tribune","paperSlogan":"From the core to the rim — we cover it all","major":{"headline":"Omnivore Logistics Established at Savronax — Gigi Takes the Helm","body1":"Omnivore Logistics has formally entered the galactic freight business, establishing its base of operations at Savronax. Gigi, the corporation's newly appointed director, confirmed the launch of its first train, the Omnivore No.1, which departed Savronax this starcycle.","body2":"\"We are here to compete,\" Gigi said in a brief public statement. The arrival of Omnivore Logistics draws immediate comparisons to The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust, which also launched recently. Whether there is room in the galaxy for both corporations remains an open question.","pageNum":1,"imgType":"ceo_gigi","_pln":{"id":336,"starId":90,"orbitRadius":3323.0077341048186,"orbitAngle":-16.988198981831268,"orbitSpeed":-0.00012266462235736652,"x":71206.25169703267,"y":-32622.127082818148,"size":"L","radius":192,"type":{"id":"resort","base":"#0e58b8","hi":"#38aaf0","rim":[65,175,255],"_b":{"id":"resort","lms":[{"cx":-0.4212699417403563,"cy":-0.5983654899090732,"rx":0.7200399612169712,"ry":0.3433939847024158,"rot":0.6739989858488433,"isLarge":true,"pts":[{"x":0.702913529956461,"y":0.26777331569037754},{"x":0.37234937795090245,"y":0.3694988499685549},{"x":-0.00037737840864769965,"y":0.22481180340909407},{"x":-0.31134172371169194,"y":0.307695390703922},{"x":-0.7635350156058841,"y":0.28991312089435434},{"x":-0.7545987764152383,"y":0.08183616005516597},{"x":-0.5377678282381353,"y":-0.05875289196231983},{"x":-0.5876700638188962,"y":-0.22387157852902448},{"x":-0.28945837562008214,"y":-0.2872424213355051},{"x":0.00042887690894144215,"y":-0.2554904815172953},{"x":0.3429239458303613,"y":-0.3389077321088948},{"x":0.674212779207406,"y":-0.25599759928727095},{"x":0.5752404825293836,"y":-0.062384771443865