s-Stellar Railways Trust crossed a significant financial threshold this starcycle, logging its highest net revenue figure since founding.","line2":"Analysts see the milestone as confirmation that the corporation's strategy is delivering results.","pageNum":9},"minor2":{"headline":"Credit Tracker: The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust Earns Record Credits in Single Run","line1":"Freight volume data released this starcycle shows The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust leading all known operators in total cargo moved per unit of time.","line2":"The statistic reinforces The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust's reputation as the most efficient carrier in the sector.","pageNum":5}},{"sd":834,"layout":1,"issueNum":5,"paperName":"The Stellar Tribune","paperSlogan":"From the core to the rim — we cover it all","major":{"headline":"Omnivore Logistics Opens New Route: Rakkalra–Rezazan Now Active","body1":"Gigi of Omnivore Logistics announced the successful establishment of a freight corridor between Rakkalra and Rezazan, calling it a pivotal moment for the corporation.","body2":"The new route is expected to carry a mix of cargo types and could significantly increase Omnivore Logistics's revenue. Observers say the move shows Omnivore Logistics is serious about competing with The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust across the galaxy.","pageNum":10,"imgType":"star","_pln":{"id":692,"starId":187,"orbitRadius":5090.00609,"orbitAngle":51.368717324561295,"orbitSpeed":0.0001,"x":68235.33453832753,"y":-14539.79744579562,"size":"XL","radius":288,"type":{"id":"ice","base":"#78b8e8","hi":"#c8eeff","rim":[140,200,255]},"name":"Rezazan","isStarter":false,"biomeSeed":3421760026,"moons":[{"r":48,"orbitR":639.1024973241854,"angle":2604.251278615803,"speed":0.005077585723678614,"tilt":1.5707963267948966,"incl":0.2900428573338663,"pocks":[{"dx":-0.5936730525314912,"dy":-0.4905476128127942,"r":0.22238782341299657},{"dx":0.23202559809770884,"dy":-0.17673884272037715,"r":0.396384451573195},{"dx":-0.4490399112016473,"dy":0.2