edge":"#005544"}},"image":{"kind":"real_star","starId":227}},"minor1":{"headline":"Omnivore Logistics Funding Shortfall Delays Planned Expansion","line1":"A Omnivore Logistics freight train was reported grounded near Rezazan this starcycle after a routine inspection uncovered mechanical faults.","line2":"Repairs are underway and the train is expected to return to service within the starcycle.","pageNum":10},"minor2":{"headline":"Omnivore Logistics Quarterly Report Shows Stagnant Growth","line1":"Omnivore Logistics has withdrawn a route application near Gigi Prime, citing strategic review — a move observers say signals a retreat from the sector.","line2":"The withdrawal leaves The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust as the sole operator in the corridor for the foreseeable future.","pageNum":9}},{"sd":835,"layout":2,"issueNum":6,"paperName":"The Stellar Tribune","paperSlogan":"From the core to the rim — we cover it all","major":{"headline":"Delivery Complete: Omnivore Logistics Drops Passengers at Geistra","body1":"Omnivore Logistics logged another completed Passengers delivery to Geistra this starcycle, the latest in a series of runs that Gigi says demonstrates the corporation's reliability.","body2":"The delivery contributes to growing Omnivore Logistics revenue and adds to the pressure on The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust to maintain its edge in the sector. Industry analysts are watching both corporations closely.","pageNum":3,"imgType":"cargo","_pln":{"id":992,"starId":267,"orbitRadius":3065.49557,"orbitAngle":-61.044290521794906,"orbitSpeed":-0.00013,"x":85137.4103295819,"y":-22512.277974718294,"size":"S","radius":48,"type":{"id":"resort","base":"#0e58b8","hi":"#38aaf0","rim":[65,175,255],"_b":{"id":"resort","lms":[{"cx":-0.2540785043319104,"cy":0.5668161748621253,"rx":0.5035087077505886,"ry":0.41615762749686835,"rot":3.077920625394245,"isLarge":true,"pts":[{"x":-0.3640992718832474,"y":0.019186988645303844},{"x":-0.6308518429856068,"y":-0.21136332628874552},{"x":-0.45161