ailways Trust","line1":"Gigi of Omnivore Logistics announced the opening of a new route to Caldoniara, citing growing demand and favorable trade conditions.","line2":"The move puts Omnivore Logistics in direct competition with The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust in the corridor, with both corporations eyeing the same cargo flows.","pageNum":10},"minor2":{"headline":"Omnivore Logistics Engine Overheats Near Tyr: Crew Safe, Route Delayed","line1":"Omnivore Logistics has withdrawn a route application near Tyr, citing strategic review — a move observers say signals a retreat from the sector.","line2":"The withdrawal leaves The Trans-Stellar Railways Trust as the sole operator in the corridor for the foreseeable future.","pageNum":8}}]}